# ============================================================================
# NOTE: `token` is deliberately NOT ignored in this repo.
# This is a PRIVATE repo and the Command Code key is committed on purpose so a
# clone works without extra setup.
#
# If this repo is ever made public, forked, or shared: ROTATE THE KEY FIRST.
#   https://commandcode.ai/settings/billing
#   /root/cc-proxy/set-key.sh user_NEW_KEY
# ============================================================================

